{"id":"n77276-1-10","stage":3,"title":"중고차 · 二手车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77276-1-10-1","ko":"여보, 우리 차 한 대 사는 게 좋겠어요.","zh":"亲爱的，我们买辆车吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보,","meaning":"喂，老婆，老公","explanation":"여보：喂，老婆，老公","readings":[{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58165","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"차","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"대","meaning":"辆，架，台","explanation":"대：辆，架，台","readings":[{"term":"대","audio":"/audio/364d448a22b1512f4d3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40639","senseId":"1","lemma":"대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대","audio":"/audio/364d448a22b1512f4d3c.mp3"}},{"text":"사는","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사는","audio":"/audio/30f3407ddedb23e84811.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어요","audio":"/audio/3b8ae824a2c33a5f4527.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7809541ae162d432","term":"여보","zh":"喂，老婆，老公","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3","entryId":"58165","definition":"夫妇之间的称谓。","pronunciation":["여보"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"364d448a22b1512f","term":"대","zh":"辆，架，台","audio":"/audio/364d448a22b1512f4d3c.mp3","entryId":"40639","definition":"计算车辆、飞机、乐器、机械等的计量单位。","pronunciation":["대"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3831f427097f4a812eea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77276-1-10-2","ko":"그럼, 저렴하게 중고차로 삽시다.","zh":"那我们就买辆便宜的二手车吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼,","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"저렴하게","meaning":"便宜","explanation":"저렴하다：便宜；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렴하다","audio":"/audio/c3522148de6accd3068c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74099","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렴하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렴하게","audio":"/audio/276a6fdd406943dbab67.mp3"}},{"text":"중고차로","meaning":"二手车","explanation":"중고차：二手车；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"중고차","audio":"/audio/5c57da9a7b2eabb5c84c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77276","senseId":"1","lemma":"중고차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중고차로","audio":"/audio/e8d423ac87f5e5e1a143.mp3"}},{"text":"삽시다.","meaning":"买吧","explanation":"사다：买、购买；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삽시다","audio":"/audio/88772a430e28a1745276.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"c3522148de6accd3","term":"저렴하다","zh":"便宜","audio":"/audio/c3522148de6accd3068c.mp3","entryId":"74099","definition":"价格低廉。","pronunciation":["저ː렴하다"]},{"id":"5c57da9a7b2eabb5","term":"중고차","zh":"二手车","audio":"/audio/5c57da9a7b2eabb5c84c.mp3","entryId":"77276","definition"